{
  "_about": "Hand-labelled by one reader (the author of the extractor, not blind to its design) from the text of the 12 FDA summaries in research/feasibility/fixtures/fda. Values are what the DOCUMENT states, not what the extractor produced. 'results' lists narrative performance statements about the subject device (tables are not labelled). Fields: versions = device software version strings written in the document; ifuAge* = age limits in the Indications for Use (null = none written); studyAge* = age limits written for the study population; settings = care settings named in the Indications for Use, in the extractor's vocabulary; sampleSizes / siteCounts = counts the document gives for its studies (not exhaustive); ncts = registered trial identifiers written in the document; results[].headline = true when a reviewer would take the figure as the device's overall observed result (false for goals, subgroups, corrected analyses, reader arms, per-condition figures).",
